					3.88
				</span></i>
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-άουσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					3.995
				</span></i>
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γοόωσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Q.S.
					2.648
				</span></i>
			: 
				Dor.
			
			3pl.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-άοντι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Mosch.
					3.24
				</span></i>
			; opt. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γοάοιμεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					24.664
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γοάοιεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					24
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				190
			</span></i>; 
				Ep.
			
			inf.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γοήμεναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					14.502
				</span></i>
			; part.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γοόων, -όωσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					6.373
				</span></i>
			, etc.: 
				Ep.
			
			impf.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γόων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					10.567
				</span></i>
			 (
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γόον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					6.500
				</span></i>
