				Ion.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γοάασκεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					8.92
				</span></i>
			: 
				Ep.
			
			fut.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γοήσομαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					21.124
				</span></i>
			, later 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γοήσω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					7.638
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Crin.
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				Nonn.
				<u>D.</u>
				2.137
			</span></i>: aor. 1
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγόησα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					12(7).445
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Amorgos</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				7.599
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Jul.
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				611
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Eutolm.
			</span></i>):—
				Med.
			, Trag. (v. infr.) and once in Prose, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				4.6.9
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, v. infr.:—<i>groan, weep</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				8.92
			</span></i>, etc.: c. acc., <i>bewail</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				16.857
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπέρ τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Mosch.
					4.83
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			 (never in <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> exc. in fut.), 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γοᾶσθε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pers.</u>
					1072
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ch.</u>
				632
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀδύρματα τὴν Ἡράκλειον ἔξοδον
					γοωμένην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Tr.</u>
					51
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφί νιν γοώμενος</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				937
			</span></i>:— 
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γοᾶται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ch.</u>
					632
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μακρὰ γοηθείς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					7.371
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Crin.
			</span></i>).</div>
